\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c & =AB=7\\text{ mm} \\\\ b & =AC \\\\ m∠A & ={30}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘}=\\frac{1}{2},\n$$\n\nwe can calculate $b=AC,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot b\\cdot c\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡A \\\\ \\frac{21}{2} & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot b\\cdot 7\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘} \\\\ \\frac{21}{2} & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot b\\cdot 7\\cdot (\\frac{1}{2}) \\\\ \\frac{21}{2} & =\\frac{7}{4}b \\\\ b & =\\frac{\\frac{21}{2}}{\\frac{7}{4}} \\\\ b & =6\\text{ mm}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe conclude that $AC=6\\,\\text{mm}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["6aa58fe6-f607-5e65-9bfb-7b994370d6eb"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "e58fd08d-b267-5054-b6b3-5f527b011d62" :answer/id #uuid "e58fd08d-b267-5054-b6b3-5f527b011d62" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "11" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "b95465e1-7344-5da1-aa23-1e10084425be" :answer-field/id #uuid "b95465e1-7344-5da1-aa23-1e10084425be" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/choices ["e58fd08d-b267-5054-b6b3-5f527b011d62"] :answer-field/correct "e58fd08d-b267-5054-b6b3-5f527b011d62" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "6d83188f-3c9c-5519-8dd9-2926295c7f28" :question/id #uuid "6d83188f-3c9c-5519-8dd9-2926295c7f28" :question/problem "![](images/aa/aa571435e7a44532cfb3bc61965b56b10e83c090236349851971e1b51c007ade.png)\n\nThe area of the triangle $△ABC$ is $\\frac{11}{2}\\,\\text{cm}^{2}.$ Use $\\sin30^{\\circ}=\\frac{1}{2}.$ Then, $AC=${{field-1}} $\\text{cm}.$" :question/worked-solution "The formula for the area of the triangle is \n\n$$\nA=\\frac{1}{2}bc\\operatorname{sin}⁡A,\n$$\n\nwhere $∠A$ is between the sides of lengths $b$ and $c.$ \n\nHere\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c & =AB=2\\text{ cm} \\\\ b & =AC \\\\ m∠A & ={30}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘}=\\frac{1}{2},\n$$\n\nwe can calculate $b=AC,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot b\\cdot c\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡A \\\\ \\frac{11}{2} & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot b\\cdot 2\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘} \\\\ \\frac{11}{2} & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot b\\cdot 2\\cdot (\\frac{1}{2}) \\\\ \\frac{11}{2} & =\\frac{1}{2}b \\\\ b & =\\frac{\\frac{11}{2}}{\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\ b & =11\\text{ cm}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe conclude that $AC=11\\,\\text{cm}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["b95465e1-7344-5da1-aa23-1e10084425be"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "a73e2f82-dd31-522b-a8ff-6eef633e73a3" :answer/id #uuid "a73e2f82-dd31-522b-a8ff-6eef633e73a3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "87d54dc0-a53e-58a3-a119-3352cee247d0" :answer-field/id #uuid "87d54dc0-a53e-58a3-a119-3352cee247d0" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/choices ["a73e2f82-dd31-522b-a8ff-6eef633e73a3"] :answer-field/correct "a73e2f82-dd31-522b-a8ff-6eef633e73a3" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "314a7d13-6708-5c30-aa96-313fb367c9f2" :question/id #uuid "314a7d13-6708-5c30-aa96-313fb367c9f2" :question/problem "![](images/52/52e6b64e78550f0e1cfeecc59a606921b52af85c457fff5e936f45a0a732c243.png)\n\nThe area of the triangle $△ABC$ is $1\\,\\text{cm}^{2}.$ Use $\\sin30^{\\circ}=\\frac{1}{2}.$ Then, $AC=${{field-1}} $\\text{cm}.$" :question/worked-solution "The formula for the area of the triangle is \n\n$$\nA=\\frac{1}{2}bc\\operatorname{sin}⁡A,\n$$\n\nwhere $∠A$ is between the sides of lengths $b$ and $c.$ \n\nHere\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c & =AB=2\\text{ cm} \\\\ b & =AC \\\\ m∠A & ={30}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘}=\\frac{1}{2},\n$$\n\nwe can calculate $b=AC,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot b\\cdot c\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡A \\\\ 1 & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot b\\cdot 2\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘} \\\\ 1 & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot b\\cdot 2\\cdot (\\frac{1}{2}) \\\\ 1 & =\\frac{1}{2}b \\\\ b & =\\frac{1}{\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\ b & =2\\text{ cm}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe conclude that $AC=2\\,\\text{cm}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["87d54dc0-a53e-58a3-a119-3352cee247d0"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "be2b91f6-33c1-5954-a33e-cc9bb1fc00d5" :answer/id #uuid "be2b91f6-33c1-5954-a33e-cc9bb1fc00d5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6\\,\\text{mm}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "699c9cce-8a3f-504a-9e1e-377dcaf6d9a5" :answer/id #uuid "699c9cce-8a3f-504a-9e1e-377dcaf6d9a5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{12}{7}\\,\\text{mm}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "9f45421b-397d-5cab-bffe-76d40e55a16c" :answer/id #uuid "9f45421b-397d-5cab-bffe-76d40e55a16c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7\\,\\text{mm}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "5e921faf-0281-5de4-bf04-ba62e8162874" :answer/id #uuid "5e921faf-0281-5de4-bf04-ba62e8162874" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "588\\,\\text{mm}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "21e394a0-4396-57b5-ba84-afbe61d23d31" :answer/id #uuid "21e394a0-4396-57b5-ba84-afbe61d23d31" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12\\,\\text{mm}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "29c21173-5edd-5986-a7d2-4d49cd79bb99" :answer-field/id #uuid "29c21173-5edd-5986-a7d2-4d49cd79bb99" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["be2b91f6-33c1-5954-a33e-cc9bb1fc00d5" "699c9cce-8a3f-504a-9e1e-377dcaf6d9a5" "9f45421b-397d-5cab-bffe-76d40e55a16c" "5e921faf-0281-5de4-bf04-ba62e8162874" "21e394a0-4396-57b5-ba84-afbe61d23d31"] :answer-field/correct "21e394a0-4396-57b5-ba84-afbe61d23d31" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "2b1fe735-eecc-5ad7-8e31-5e8090182857" :question/id #uuid "2b1fe735-eecc-5ad7-8e31-5e8090182857" :question/problem "![](images/3f/3f14b28ecb2ab34328e461e66b6c00c5516b99d559e6