},\n$$\n\nwe can calculate $b=AC,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot b\\cdot c\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡A \\\\ \\frac{121\\sqrt{3}}{18} & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot b\\cdot \\frac{22}{3}\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡{120}^{∘} \\\\ \\frac{121\\sqrt{3}}{18} & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot b\\cdot \\frac{22}{3}\\cdot (\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}) \\\\ \\frac{121\\sqrt{3}}{18} & =\\frac{11\\sqrt{3}}{6}b \\\\ b & =\\frac{\\frac{121\\sqrt{3}}{18}}{\\frac{11\\sqrt{3}}{6}} \\\\ b & =\\frac{11}{3}\\text{ cm}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe conclude that $AC=\\frac{11}{3}\\,\\text{cm}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["bbbc8209-c356-5838-910a-0345574f25e3"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "c7a49011-c8bc-51fd-afcb-da77715502e3" :answer/id #uuid "c7a49011-c8bc-51fd-afcb-da77715502e3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{29}{4}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "9cc606c1-2c28-59df-8aad-3ba11c6cce9b" :answer-field/id #uuid "9cc606c1-2c28-59df-8aad-3ba11c6cce9b" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/choices ["c7a49011-c8bc-51fd-afcb-da77715502e3"] :answer-field/correct "c7a49011-c8bc-51fd-afcb-da77715502e3" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "3adcb0ec-bc29-5a54-9e87-f2d6aa44e246" :question/id #uuid "3adcb0ec-bc29-5a54-9e87-f2d6aa44e246" :question/problem "![](images/76/76bdcef8f267043fe1f9c97f989ff3d6bfdf3b071158501cf43aef78976e93eb.png)\n\nThe area of the triangle $△ABC$ is $\\frac{1247\\sqrt{2}}{64}\\,\\text{cm}^{2}.$ Then, $AC=${{field-1}} $\\text{cm}.$" :question/worked-solution "The formula for the area of the triangle is \n\n$$\nA=\\frac{1}{2}bc\\operatorname{sin}⁡A,\n$$\n\nwhere $∠A$ is between the sides of lengths $b$ and $c.$ \n\nHere\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c & =AB=\\frac{43}{4}\\text{ cm} \\\\ b & =AC \\\\ m∠A & ={45}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡{45}^{∘}=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2},\n$$\n\nwe can calculate $b=AC,$ as follows:\n\n$$\